GET Auth Status
    [Documentation]    Sends a GET request to /api/v1/auth/status and returns the response. Always
    ...    public, regardless of the app.security.enabled toggle (see ADR-0055).
    # ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    Get Mais Saude Publica Session

    ${response}=    GET On Session
    ...    msp_session
    ...    ${BASE_URL}${STATUS_ENDPOINT}
    ...    expected_status=ANY

    Log    ${response.status_code}
    Log    ${response.text}

    RETURN    ${response}
